  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mapping Actors and Networks in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mapping Actors and Networks in Ukraine (MANU) aims at providing in-depth analyses and nuanced insights into Ukraine&#x2019;s political economy of war based on a unique database of more than 3,000 actors in the country and the vast informal networks that connect them. The proposed project builds on a database, developed in an initial research phase, that documents the connections between military, militias, crowdfunding activists, political parties, and various powerful patrons</narrative>
  </description>
